<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of Aug 14.</p>
<p>				     Aug 14/Aug 13    Aug 14/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.03		 9.11</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.04		 7.28</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.40		14.46</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    0.06		59.27</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.41		43.12</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.43		43.85</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.07		19.77</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.09		36.36</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.44		54.34</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.47		52.83</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.42		35.43</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.13	     110.83</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,869,847,126,240</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  2,031,903,901,404</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,472,828,154,056</p>
<p>  International funds			   106,463,870,794</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    258,651,199,986</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
